{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/95cd73a99945ec2b77551e3d5b0fb9e4.poster.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/95cd73a99945ec2b77551e3d5b0fb9e4.webm?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/95cd73a99945ec2b77551e3d5b0fb9e4.mp4?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/967f21d9d5d93e34c6f7aed4d1ad9b19.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LHEA awakens in the <strong>In-Between</strong>, a dreamy world between life and death. Mentored by an ancient Word Spirit, help her master a unique and innovative timeline battle system and guide lost souls to their next lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/5fbe294ef230e92eeb196cec3c7831da.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the realms, <strong>battle</strong>\u00a0strong entities,\u00a0<strong>discover\u00a0</strong>knowledge spells and\u00a0<strong>upgrade</strong>\u00a0your Fate Flute to seal the realms and restore balance in the In-Between!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/91969fb52afc51dd1df03b9ea59eddb8.poster.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/91969fb52afc51dd1df03b9ea59eddb8.webm?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/91969fb52afc51dd1df03b9ea59eddb8.mp4?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/11e391be3ffbc889d4201dfadf348854.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIMELINE BATTLE SYSTEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate and create the optimal battle timeline. Every decision matters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use State of Mind power-ups to boost your battle efficiency.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FATE FLUTE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and upgrade up to 9 enchanted rings across 3 customizable presets, each granting the ability to cast knowledge spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/6f5486433e634d365d4da870f6215cba.poster.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/6f5486433e634d365d4da870f6215cba.webm?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/6f5486433e634d365d4da870f6215cba.mp4?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KNOWLEDGE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the realms to discover their hidden knowledge, gain powerful spells and unlock special features that will help you conquer the In-Between.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALM MAPS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different! Adapt your strategy to challenges and surprises you encounter in the procedurally generated realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/d19f8b8466cc15cf42e65f5f757cfffc.poster.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/d19f8b8466cc15cf42e65f5f757cfffc.webm?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/d19f8b8466cc15cf42e65f5f757cfffc.mp4?t=1767107267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MUCH MORE...!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It would ruin the fun a bit if everything was revealed on this page! :) Find out how to optimize your runs and complete your objectives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>May the stars align in your favor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572530/extras/727ed7dc6c86cb3a1cd9c45bc856b11e.avif?t=1767107267\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About SOUL FUEL GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in 2023 by solo developer Jo Drolet, Soul Fuel Games aims to create video games filled with LIGHT and unpredictability. LHEA and the Word Spirit is 